  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Vignesh vs The Deptuy Director Health Officer on 25 March, 2024 Author: D.Bharatha Chakravarthy Bench: Sanjay V.Gangapurwala, D.Bharatha Chakravarthy Wp No.1825 of In The High Court Of Judicature At Madras Dated: 25.03.2024 Coram The Hon'Ble Mr.Sanjay V.Gangapurwala, Chief Justice And The Hon'Ble Mr.Justice D.Bharatha Chakravarthy Wp No.1825 of 2024 Vignesh .. Petitioner -vs- 1. The Deptuy Director Health Officer, Thamaraipakkam Road, Ekkadu, Thiruvallur District. 2. The Food Safety Officer, Food Safety, Second Floor, Collectorate Office, Thiruvallur, Thiruvallur District . 3. The Revenue Divisional Officer, Thiruvallur, Thiruvallur District. 4. The Tahsildar, Poonamallee Taluk, Poonamallee. 5. The Block Development Officer, Poonamallee B.D.O. Office, Poonamallee, Chennai. 6. The Inspector of Police, Poonamallee Police Station, Poonamallee, Chennai. Page 1 of 4 Vignesh vs The Deptuy Director Health Officer on 25 March, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/164016774/ 1 https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis Wp 7. Bhavani 8. Annamalai .. R Prayer: Petition filed under Article 226 of the Constitution of Ind issuance of a Writ of Mandamus directing the respondents 1 to 6 to remove the encroachment made by the respondents 7 and 8 in front of the petitioner's shop at No.3/159A, Thandarai Main Road, Pidarithangal, Banavedu Thottam, Poonamallee Taluk, Tiruvallur District based on the petitioner's representations dated 08.12.2022 22.12.2022 and 09.10.2023. For the Petitioner : Mr.P.Krishnan For the Respondents : Mr.P.Harish Govt. Advocate for RR 1 to 5 : Mr.S.Sugendran Addl. Public Prosecutor for R : Not ready in notice reg. RR 7 **** * ORDER (Made by the Hon'ble Chief Justice) 4. The Tahsildar, Poonamallee Taluk, Poonamallee. 5. The Block Development Officer, Poonamallee B.D.O. Office, Poonamallee, Chennai. https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis THE HON'BLE CHIEF JUSTICE AND D.BHARATHA CHAKRAVARTHY, J. (sra) 6. The Inspector of Police, Poonamallee Police Station, Poonamallee, Chennai. 25.03.2024 https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis Vignesh vs The Deptuy Director Health Officer on 25 March, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/164016774/ 3",
